// This is used in CREATE TABLE statements to provide an explicit column
// definition.
//
// if
// <is
// _hidden> is TRUE, then the column won't show up in SELECT * queries.
//
// if
// <generated
// _column_info> is non-NULL, then this column is a generated
// column.
//
// if
// <default
// _value> is non-NULL, then this column has default value.
//
// <generated
// _column_info> and
// <default
