//
//	compute prior to computing the final
//
// <function
// _expression>.
//
//	See below.
//
// <function
// _expression> is the resolved SQL expression invoked for the
//
//	function. This will be unset for external language functions. For
//	non-template SQL functions, this is a resolved representation of
//	the expression in
//
// .
//
