// <determinism
// _level> is the declared determinism level of the function.
//
//	Values are 'DETERMINISTIC', 'NOT DETERMINISTIC', 'IMMUTABLE',
//	'STABLE', 'VOLATILE'.
//
// <is
// _remote> is true if this is an remote function. It is true iff its
//
